      "description": "QuickNovel is an open-source Android application designed for downloading, organizing, and reading light novels and web novels directly on your device. Rather than hosting content, it utilizes a modular web scraping system to fetch stories from various online sources and convert them into readable formats or EPUB/PDF files.\n\nKey features:\n\n- Download novels for offline reading in EPUB or PDF formats\n- Built-in customizable reader with text sizing, fonts, and night mode\n- Integrated online translation support for foreign language sources\n- Advanced search and filtering across multiple provider sources\n- Built-in Text-To-Speech (TTS) integration for listening on the go\n- Organized library management with bookmarks, history, and reading progress\n- Completely ad-free and open-source experience\n- Optimized interface for Android phones and tablets\n",
